# Copy to `.env` (already gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Bun automatically loads `.env` for any `bun run` command, including
# `bun run --cwd packages/game run` / `edit` — and godot-bin spawns the
# Godot process with `extendEnv: true`, so these reach `OS.get_environment`
# inside the game via `GodotConfig.layerAddEnvironment` (see Runtime.ts).

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
